            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "vicalee110"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used this to marinate boneless breasts. Really liked the subtle flavor! Like another reviewer, I couldn’t find pineapple preserves so I used apricot. It did make the grill a little sticky, but it burned off nicely. Used soy oil.",
